{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 2, "text": "“改都雅”（敬门神）仪式，设坛奉献猪肉、公鸡、酒、糯米饭等祭品。此仪式由舅家选择一", "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 286, "w": 1560, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "“改都雅”（敬门神）仪式，设坛奉献猪肉、公鸡、酒、糯米饭等祭品。此仪式由舅家选择一", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 105, "y": 286, "w": 1560, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 3, "text": "对竹节一致、高矮相同的金竹，当时砍下（竹尖留有竹叶表示生命旺盛），派两名男性长者", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 354, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "对竹节一致、高矮相同的金竹，当时砍下（竹尖留有竹叶表示生命旺盛），派两名男性长者", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 354, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 4, "text": "送竹前来祝贺，意力“神竹", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 418, "w": 490, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "送竹前来祝贺，意力“神竹", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 418, "w": 490, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 5, "text": "送子”。祭师布摩先生用青", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 483, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "送子”。祭师布摩先生用青", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 483, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 6, "text": "竹弯成拱门，门上挂着红纸", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 551, "w": 490, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "竹弯成拱门，门上挂着红纸", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 551, "w": 490, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 7, "text": "人三排（每排9人）。纸人", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 616, "w": 490, "h": 44}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "人三排（每排9人）。纸人", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 616, "w": 490, "h": 44}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 8, "text": "图案互相牵手，示子孙发达。", "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 680, "w": 490, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "图案互相牵手，示子孙发达。", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 680, "w": 490, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 9, "text": "布摩诵祭词谢赐子，祈祷祖", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 740, "w": 494, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布摩诵祭词谢赐子，祈祷祖", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 740, "w": 494, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 10, "text": "神保佑，又将神竹安放到孕", "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 809, "w": 486, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神保佑，又将神竹安放到孕", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 809, "w": 486, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 11, "text": "妇卧室门口或床头上方。相", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 869, "w": 494, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "妇卧室门口或床头上方。相", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 869, "w": 494, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 12, "text": "信经此仪式，孕妇便能顺利", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 933, "w": 499, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "信经此仪式，孕妇便能顺利", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 933, "w": 499, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 13, "text": "生产，不出意外事故。这根", "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1002, "w": 486, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "生产，不出意外事故。这根", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1002, "w": 486, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 14, "text": "神竹需保留到该妇女超过生", "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1062, "w": 490, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "神竹需保留到该妇女超过生", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1062, "w": 490, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 15, "text": "育年龄时才能取下。在盘江", "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 1127, "w": 494, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "育年龄时才能取下。在盘江", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1166, "y": 1127, "w": 494, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 16, "text": "荔波做祧仪式", "bbox_px": {"x": 515, "y": 1187, "w": 213, "h": 36}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "荔波做祧仪式", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 515, "y": 1187, "w": 213, "h": 36}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 17, "text": "西岸举行这种仪式时，是由", "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1191, "w": 486, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "西岸举行这种仪式时，是由", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1191, "w": 486, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 18, "text": "布摩先生采新鲜大楠竹破成", "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1255, "w": 490, "h": 49}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "布摩先生采新鲜大楠竹破成", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 1170, "y": 1255, "w": 490, "h": 49}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 19, "text": "一个船形，竹船下扎茅人，茅人身缠一支竹浆，作为祈子神物。将此物放在主家水缸脚祭", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1320, "w": 1548, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "一个船形，竹船下扎茅人，茅人身缠一支竹浆，作为祈子神物。将此物放在主家水缸脚祭", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1320, "w": 1548, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 20, "text": "祀，以竹船渡魂魄过盘江，孕妇便能顺利生育。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1384, "w": 800, "h": 56}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "祀，以竹船渡魂魄过盘江，孕妇便能顺利生育。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1384, "w": 800, "h": 56}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 21, "text": "（二）诞生习俗", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1456, "w": 262, "h": 46}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "（二）诞生习俗", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 1456, "w": 262, "h": 46}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 22, "text": "1. 分娩。布依族妇女分娩时，请有接生经验的邻里或亲戚妇女来接生，用茅草叶来", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1517, "w": 1467, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "1. 分娩。布依族妇女分娩时，请有接生经验的邻里或亲戚妇女来接生，用茅草叶来", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1517, "w": 1467, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 23, "text": "拂打帐肉房内，以驱除邪魔。将婴儿胎盘用稻草包扎于竹上，意即以竹助长，繁茂如竹。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1585, "w": 1548, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "拂打帐肉房内，以驱除邪魔。将婴儿胎盘用稻草包扎于竹上，意即以竹助长，繁茂如竹。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1585, "w": 1548, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 24, "text": "妇女产子后的一个月之内，不出门，不干活，专心养体，护理婴儿。", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1650, "w": 1130, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "妇女产子后的一个月之内，不出门，不干活，专心养体，护理婴儿。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1650, "w": 1130, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 25, "text": "2. 请奶娘。布依族妇女生孩子后，不管有无奶汁，都要按习俗请一位健康的奶娘给", "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1714, "w": 1467, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "2. 请奶娘。布依族妇女生孩子后，不管有无奶汁，都要按习俗请一位健康的奶娘给", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 189, "y": 1714, "w": 1467, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 26, "text": "婴儿喂奶，时隔数日，婴儿才能吃母亲的奶汁。奶娘一般不要任何报酬，等到孩子长大懂", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1774, "w": 1544, "h": 53}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "婴儿喂奶，时隔数日，婴儿才能吃母亲的奶汁。奶娘一般不要任何报酬，等到孩子长大懂", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1774, "w": 1544, "h": 53}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 27, "text": "事后，其父亲便告诉孩子的奶娘是谁，以便日后记情报恩。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1839, "w": 1005, "h": 52}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "事后，其父亲便告诉孩子的奶娘是谁，以便日后记情报恩。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 1839, "w": 1005, "h": 52}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 28, "text": "3.过三朝（布依语：更占罕）。孩子生下的第三个早晨，亲戚和家族中的妇女带着礼", "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1907, "w": 1463, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 0.5, "blocks": [{"text": "3.过三朝（布依语：更占罕）。孩子生下的第三个早晨，亲戚和家族中的妇女带着礼", "conf": 0.5, "bbox_px": {"x": 193, "y": 1907, "w": 1463, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 29, "text": "物前来祝贺，礼物有花布、童衣、童毯、小帽、小鞋、母鸡、糯米、花糯米饭、鸡蛋、甜酒等，主", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1967, "w": 1548, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "物前来祝贺，礼物有花布、童衣、童毯、小帽、小鞋、母鸡、糯米、花糯米饭、鸡蛋、甜酒等，主", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 1967, "w": 1548, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 30, "text": "家回赠客人一篮五色糯米饭和鸡肉块。还请布摩举行“招魂”仪式或“卜卦”、“驱鬼”等。", "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 2023, "w": 1544, "h": 66}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "家回赠客人一篮五色糯米饭和鸡肉块。还请布摩举行“招魂”仪式或“卜卦”、“驱鬼”等。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 116, "y": 2023, "w": 1544, "h": 66}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 31, "text": "若生男孩，供桌上放一本书或笔墨纸张，希望孩子长大读书做官；若生女孩，则放一把剪", "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 2104, "w": 1544, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "若生男孩，供桌上放一本书或笔墨纸张，希望孩子长大读书做官；若生女孩，则放一把剪", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 113, "y": 2104, "w": 1544, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 32, "text": "刀、一块土花布或针线，希望女儿日后纺纱织布，刺绣挑花，心灵手巧。在贵阳市郊区举", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2169, "w": 1540, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "刀、一块土花布或针线，希望女儿日后纺纱织布，刺绣挑花，心灵手巧。在贵阳市郊区举", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2169, "w": 1540, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 33, "text": "行此仪式时，生育男孩者需栽一蓬金竹，生育女孩则需栽一蓬水竹。", "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2233, "w": 1166, "h": 48}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "行此仪式时，生育男孩者需栽一蓬金竹，生育女孩则需栽一蓬水竹。", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 117, "y": 2233, "w": 1166, "h": 48}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 34, "text": "清镇布依族将小孩出生后第三天的活动称为“洗三”，也叫“吃三朝饭”。所谓“洗", "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 2293, "w": 1459, "h": 57}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "清镇布依族将小孩出生后第三天的活动称为“洗三”，也叫“吃三朝饭”。所谓“洗", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 197, "y": 2293, "w": 1459, "h": 57}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
{"type": "line", "doc_id": "buyi_daguan", "page": 226, "line_no": 35, "text": "三”，就是上山自采几种草药，洗净后煨水，给产妇和孩子洗澡，从头到脚把全身洗干净，", "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 2357, "w": 1540, "h": 58}, "n_blocks": 1, "min_conf": 1.0, "blocks": [{"text": "三”，就是上山自采几种草药，洗净后煨水，给产妇和孩子洗澡，从头到脚把全身洗干净，", "conf": 1.0, "bbox_px": {"x": 120, "y": 2357, "w": 1540, "h": 58}}], "canon_version": "v1.1-ocr", "engine": "vision-python-v1"}
